        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Les personnes malintentionnées tentent souvent de s’approprier ses grands pouvoirs hypnotiques pour servir leurs mauvais desseins.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "When it comes to strong hypnosis, there’s an endless number of people who utilize Malamar for their nefarious deeds.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "強力な　さいみんじゅつを 使う。　それを　利用し　悪事を 働く者は　後を　絶たない。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "どうたいの　もようを　ひからせて エモノを　あやつり　おびき　よせる。 ヒレさきは　ばつぐんの　きれあじ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il fait briller les motifs qui ornent son corps afin d’attirer ses proies. L’extrémité de ses tentacules est aussi coupante qu’un rasoir.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It flashes the pattern on its torso to control its prey and draw them in. The edges of its fins are supremely sharp.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "胴体の　模様を　光らせて エモノを　操り　おびき　よせる。 ヒレ先は　抜群の　切れ味。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "はっこうたいの　ひかりを　みつめると たちまち　さいみんじょうたいになり カラマネロに　あやつられてしまう。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il manipule à sa guise ceux qui se sont laissé hypnotiser en observant son corps lumineux trop longtemps.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Gazing at its luminescent spots will quickly induce a hypnotic state, putting the observer under Malamar’s control.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "発光体の　光を　見つめると たちまち　催眠状態になり カラマネロに　操られてしまう。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "れきしを　かえるほどの　だいじけんは カラマネロの　さいみん　のうりょくが かかわっていたと　いわれている。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "On raconte que ses pouvoirs hypnotiques seraient à l’origine d’évènements qui ont bouleversé le cours de l’Histoire.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It’s said that Malamar’s hypnotic powers played a role in certain history-changing events.",
